  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Un fragment de comète, tombé au sol\nquand elle traversait l’atmosphère.\nLes amateurs en donnent un bon prix.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A shard which fell to the ground when\na comet approached.\nA maniac will buy it for a high price.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A shard which fell to the ground when\na comet approached.\nA maniac will buy it for a high price.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "すいせいが　ちかづいたとき\nちひょうに　おちた　かけら。\nショップで　たかく　うれる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "혜성이 가까워졌을 때\n지표면에 떨어진 조각.\n상점에서 비싸게 팔린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fragment de comète, tombé au sol quand elle\ntraversait l’atmosphère. Peut être vendu à bon\nprix aux magasins.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Kometensplitter, der aus dem All\nherabgefallen ist. Er ist von großem Wert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta bastante la Defensa en combate.\nAl cambiar de Pokémon, el efecto desaparece.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Scheggia di cometa caduta al suolo. Si può\nvendere a un prezzo piuttosto alto nei negozi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A shard that fell to the ground\nwhen a comet approached. It can\nbe sold at a high price to shops.",
